    "id": "mukul975--anthropic-cybersecurity-skills--testing-websocket-api-security",
    "name": "testing-websocket-api-security",
    "description": "Tests WebSocket API implementations for missing upgrade-handshake authentication, Cross-Site WebSocket Hijacking (CSWSH), message injection, insufficient input validation, message-flooding DoS, and information leakage, using Burp Suite's WebSocket interception and the wscat CLI to craft malicious payloads. Use for real-time API penetration testing or CSWSH/authorization-bypass assessments on WebSocket channels.",
